Now it is midday.
Now it is my break time.
Rohan and I stop our work.
We go to the canteen.
The canteen is very large.
Many people are there.
We sit near a table there.
My lunchbox is in my bag.
Now I open my lunchbox.
But Rohan buys hot food from the counter.
He brings a food plate.
"Maya, what is your food?" Rohan asks.
"This is food from my home," I say.
Now we eat the food.
Rohan's food is also good.
We laugh and make conversation.
This break time is very pleasant.
Then we do our work again.
